WEBVTT

00:00.800 --> 00:03.660
You have done the deep work.

00:03.660 --> 00:08.260
You have your first draft of your M.V.P. blueprint,

00:08.260 --> 00:12.900
your performance operating system, your compass.

00:12.900 --> 00:17.240
But most people write a vision they'll never live.

00:17.240 --> 00:18.080
Why?

00:18.080 --> 00:21.560
Because they don't have a system for execution.

00:21.560 --> 00:24.400
That's what the 90-Day Way provides.

00:24.400 --> 00:27.420
It's your personal performance system.

00:27.420 --> 00:30.320
If your M.V.P. blueprint is the compass,

00:30.320 --> 00:34.700
the 90-Day Way is the vehicle to move you forward.

00:34.700 --> 00:37.780
It's what gives your blueprint legs.

00:37.780 --> 00:41.940
Without this system, your blueprint is just a philosophy.

00:41.940 --> 00:45.120
With it, it's unstoppable.

00:45.120 --> 00:48.320
So what makes the 90-Day Way so unique?

00:48.320 --> 00:52.960
It's how the system intentionally aligns your M.V.P. blueprint

00:52.960 --> 00:57.260
with both your personal and professional progress.

00:57.260 --> 01:01.460
This isn't just about your next career move.

01:01.460 --> 01:06.460
It's about building one integrated, fulfilled life.

01:07.400 --> 01:09.920
Now, why 90 days?

01:09.920 --> 01:13.120
Because a year is too long to plan in detail

01:13.120 --> 01:15.340
and too much can change.

01:15.340 --> 01:19.180
A week is too short to build real momentum.

01:19.180 --> 01:23.660
90 days is the perfect length for a season.

01:23.660 --> 01:26.560
It's long enough to achieve significant goals,

01:26.560 --> 01:30.600
but short enough to stay focused and agile.

01:30.600 --> 01:32.740
Your primary tools for this system

01:32.740 --> 01:36.880
is the 90-Day Way Core 4 Scorecard,

01:36.880 --> 01:39.000
which you will find in your playbook.

01:39.000 --> 01:43.400
You are building your own customized leadership algorithm.

01:43.400 --> 01:45.160
And here's the secret.

01:45.160 --> 01:47.640
This isn't just about productivity.

01:47.640 --> 01:50.360
It's about sustainability.

01:50.360 --> 01:53.360
The 90-Day Way gives you a rhythm, a cycle,

01:53.360 --> 01:56.280
a chance to sprint and recover.

01:56.280 --> 01:59.560
That's how we build momentum without burnout

01:59.560 --> 02:01.960
because a champion doesn't just play hard.

02:01.960 --> 02:04.500
They rest strategically.

02:04.500 --> 02:08.120
This scorecard is where you will translate your big goals

02:08.120 --> 02:10.920
into specific measurable actions

02:10.920 --> 02:13.740
aligned with your A.R.A.W. pillars

02:13.740 --> 02:16.120
and track your progress weekly.

02:16.120 --> 02:17.760
It's the accountability system

02:17.760 --> 02:20.740
that ensures your M.V.P. blueprint

02:20.740 --> 02:22.780
doesn't just sit on the shelf.

02:22.780 --> 02:24.400
It gets lived.

